                <mxCell id="202" value="&lt;b&gt;STAGE 2 — Repository Overview&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent: &lt;i&gt;scout&lt;/i&gt;  ·  Skill: &lt;i&gt;repo-overview&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inspects repo structure, entry points, class and module diagrams.&lt;br&gt;Writes HTML overview; summarizes key findings for downstream stages." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=5;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
