                <mxCell id="203" value="&lt;b&gt;STAGE 3 — Requirements Intake&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent: &lt;i&gt;worker&lt;/i&gt;  ·  Skill: &lt;i&gt;requirements-intake&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pre-reads: char-report + overview. Identifies gaps in requirements.&lt;br&gt;Asks targeted questions only for items not answered by prior artifacts. Cites findings." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=5;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
