                <mxCell id="204" value="&lt;b&gt;STAGE 4 — Migration Planning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent: &lt;i&gt;planner&lt;/i&gt;  ·  Skill: &lt;i&gt;migration-planner&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Defines interface contracts top-down. Plans implementation order bottom-up.&lt;br&gt;Marks each module &lt;b&gt;node_type&lt;/b&gt; (leaf/integration). Enumerates &lt;b&gt;dependency_interfaces&lt;/b&gt; per module&lt;br&gt;(e.g. Flux.jl layer protocol, JAX jit purity, PyTorch nn.Module). Flags unresolved interfaces as human gates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=5;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="410" y="870" width="510" height="106" as="geometry"/>
