                <mxCell id="404" value="&lt;b&gt;plan.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Integration nodes: sub-modules, impl sequence, interface contracts&lt;br&gt;• Leaf nodes: interface contracts, BDD context&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;node_type&lt;/b&gt; (leaf/integration)  ·  &lt;b&gt;dependency_interfaces&lt;/b&gt; (framework/library contracts)&lt;br&gt;• Parallel/sequential markers · Open questions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;arcSize=3;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
